    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d532">

                <pb facs="0588" n="472" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg472"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/1198.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Davis to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-06-20">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 20, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Government forces took Cape Haitien yesterday. Revolutionary forces retreated
                    into the woods. Considerable firing and sailors of the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Descartes</hi> landed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
